      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Mark 2 Stress. The crew executes a rehearsed cinematic play: the driver crashes through a barrier, the runner kills the lights, the sniper pins someone down, the bruiser opens a path, or the face creates a distraction.</p><p>Choose two:<br>1- The crew immediately moves anywhere within Far range, ignoring difficult terrain, cover, crowds, or minor obstacles;<br>2- One PC within Far range must succeed on an Agility or Instinct Reaction Roll or mark 2 Stress;<br>3- The crew’s next attack gains advantage and deals +1d8 damage;<br>4- A door, route, vehicle, piece of cover, or objective becomes compromised, exposed, blocked, or moved into danger.</p>",
